# Adlaire-Design WYSIWYG Editor UI Catalog

This catalog governs WYSIWYG Editor UI components and states.

`Docs/Editor_Master_Spec` governs editor details. `Docs/Master_Spec` governs the whole system.

## Scope

| Owns | Does not own |
| --- | --- |
| WYSIWYG editor shell | Generic public UI |
| Editor toolbar and inline toolbar | Admin-only UI |
| Block selection, insertion, transform, and reorder UI | Official SVG icon files |
| Mobile editor toolbar and bottom sheet | Editor runtime internals |
| Editor warning, error, readonly, disabled, locked, and save states | Brand asset files |

## Implemented Groups

| Group | Examples | State |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Shell | editor surface, header, canvas, status | 実装済み |
| Toolbar | toolbar, inline toolbar, selection toolbar | 実装済み |
| Block UI | block, selected block, insert, transform, reorder, drag handle | 実装済み |
| Content Blocks | heading, text, quote, list, media, table, code, callout | 実装済み |
| Review UI | comment, suggestion, diff, history panel | 実装済み |
| Mobile UI | mobile toolbar, mobile sheet, mobile actions | 実装済み |
| Assist UI | slash menu, assist menu, AI entry, accessibility panel | 実装済み |
| State UI | readonly, disabled, locked, alert, warning, save state, empty state | 実装済み |
| Collaboration and Review State UI | suggestion card, save banner, lock banner, comment and diff states | 実装済み |

