## Catalog Governance

| Item | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Implementation state | Use `実装済み`, `策定済み`, or `対象外`. |
| Required class families | Treat listed classes as a check-covered contract between this catalog and generated CSS. |
| Out of scope | Generic UI, Admin UI, official SVG icon files, editor runtime internals, brand assets. |
| Synchronization | Update `Docs/Master_Spec`, `Docs/Editor_Master_Spec`, generated EditorUI files, TypeScript source, and checks when needed. |
| Change unit | Specification, catalog, implementation, and check updates are reviewed together. |

Samples can demonstrate WYSIWYG Editor UI, but Samples are not the source of truth.
